WEBVTT

00:01:55.069 --> 00:02:01.209
This was one of the many, many times
in my work with indigenous people in India

00:02:01.233 --> 00:02:03.537
that I witnessed shame around food,

00:02:04.545 --> 00:02:08.171
shame that the food you love to eat,

00:02:08.195 --> 00:02:11.372
the food that has been
eaten for generations,

00:02:11.396 --> 00:02:13.416
is somehow inferior,

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.813
even subhuman.

00:02:16.008 --> 00:02:21.152
And this shame is not limited
to out-of-the-way, icky foods

00:02:21.176 --> 00:02:23.997
like insects or rats, maybe,

00:02:24.021 --> 00:02:27.203
but extends to regular foods:

00:02:27.227 --> 00:02:29.219
wild vegetables,

00:02:29.243 --> 00:02:32.035
mushrooms, flowers --